    "Reason : 1 - On 01/05/2024, the existing use of the property at '33A Winchester Road Feltham  TW13 5JX' as a two-storey self-contained dwellinghouse was not lawful within the meaning of Section 171 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\nThere is an active Breach of Condition notice in force at the site and the stated lawfulness of the property as a two-storey house would be in contravention of its requirements under section 191 of the Act. \r\n"
